<title>USA: Money Store raises qtrly dividend to $0.035.</title>
<headline>Money Store raises qtrly dividend to $0.035.</headline>
<dateline>UNION, N.J. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.035		    $0.03</p>
<p> Pay	     June 1</p>
<p> Record	  May 15</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is The Money Store.</p>
<p>The company said the increase in the dividend is the eighth increase in the last 15 years.</p>
